# Executive Flow — domain rules

Before coding, identify the **domain** and touch only that pile. Full map: `ARCHITECTURE.md`. Agent workflow: `AGENTS.md`. Deep-dives: `docs/domains/` (Sync, Meetings, Expenditure).

## Domains → primary paths

| Domain | Prefer |
|--------|--------|
| Shell / nav | `App.jsx`, `components/layout/`, `constants/navigation.js`, `utils/tabImports.js` |
| Meetings | `pages/ExecutiveCalendar.jsx`, `utils/calendar.js`, `utils/reminders.js`, `utils/morningBoardSettings.js`, `api/morning-meeting-board.js` |
| Souvenirs | `pages/SouvenirLog.jsx`, `utils/souvenirLog*.js`, `components/souvenirs/` |
| Expenditure | `pages/ExpenditureLog.jsx`, `utils/expenditure*.js`, `api/categorize-expenditure.js`, `api/weekly-expenditure-summary.js` |
| Orders | `pages/OrderLog.jsx`, `utils/order*.js` |
| Dak | `pages/DakIssuanceLog.jsx`, `utils/dak*.js` |
| Tasks | `pages/TaskLog.jsx`, `utils/task*.js` |
| Capture | `pages/CaptureInbox.jsx`, `utils/captureEntries.js` |
| Contacts | `pages/ContactDatabase.jsx`, `pages/contactDatabase/`, `utils/contact*.js`, `utils/contactCategories.js`, `api/extract-contact.js` |
| Sync | `pages/SyncBackup.jsx`, `context/CloudSync*.jsx`, `context/GoogleSheets*`, `utils/cloudSync*.js`, `api/sheets-sync.js`, `docs/CLOUD_SYNC.md` |
| Compose | `pages/ComposeDesk.jsx`, `constants/composePurposes.js`, `utils/compose*.js`, `api/compose-draft.js` |
| Labels | `pages/LabelGenerator.jsx`, `utils/fileLabel*.js`, `utils/labelPdf.js`, `utils/pafdaLogoImage.js` |
| Dashboard | `pages/DashboardOverview.jsx`, `components/dashboard/` — compose other domains; don’t own their data |

Ask Anything / Muhasaba are **removed from nav** (`navigation.js` / `tabImports.js`); do not re-add without product ask.

State for logs lives in `ExecutiveContext` + named contexts in `context/executiveDomains.js`. Persistence: `executive_flow_*` localStorage; cloud via `utils/backup.js`.

## Do

- Reuse `components/ui/` (GlassCard, Modal, FormField, StatusBadge)
- Normalize list shapes in the matching `*Entries` util
- Add new tabs via navigation + `tabImports` + page (then update `ARCHITECTURE.md`)
- Put serverless jobs under `api/` with shared helpers in `api/_lib/`

## Don’t

- Rewrite unrelated domains “while you’re here”
- Put domain logic in `App.jsx`
- Edit `dist/`
- Cross-import private page helpers; extract to `utils/` instead
- Change localStorage schema without updating normalizers

## New feature checklist

1. Name the domain  
2. Open `ARCHITECTURE.md` for that row  
3. Change page → utils → context/API as needed  
4. If a new domain appeared, update `ARCHITECTURE.md`
